  epo:specifiesProcurementCriterion <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/1017bc9c-2a29-4477-a9ce-ab4f405adae5-01/AwardCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_AwardingTerms1_AwardingCriterion1_SubordinateAwardingCriterion1>,
